%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: TheGamblerIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Heads or tails? Just \u2014 habit. I flip something whenever I\u2019m
      standing still. Here are the papers. Bidzina Chkhonia. Mostly I play cards.
      The Metropol, the back rooms, wherever I can find a clean table and honest
      odds."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "I\u2019ve been running the numbers on this checkpoint. The time variance on each pass is bigger than you\u2019d think. Somewhere between forty seconds and three minutes."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: You time this checkpoint?
      npcResponse: "I time everything. Probability doesn\u2019t work without data. The checkpoint is actually one of the more consistent variables in my day right now."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: Do you play for a living?
      npcResponse: "When the living holds still long enough to let me. Right now nothing holds still. The odds keep shifting. It\u2019s inconvenient."
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "I used to play at the Metropol most nights. That\u2019s closed now.
      Found a private game in someone\u2019s basement \u2014 lower stakes, worse
      lighting. There was a woman. She left when the odds stopped being fun for
      her. You have a very readable face, officer."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "I won\u2019t say which eye. But I\u2019d bet on it. My permit. August
      expiry. I would bet on it being correct, but that seems like pushing my luck."
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I don't have tells.
      npcResponse: "Everybody has tells. I\u2019ve spent twenty years reading them. It\u2019s not an insult. It\u2019s data."
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: Does that help at the card table?
      npcResponse: "More than the cards, honestly. The cards are just mathematics. The people are where the game actually lives."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
